# The robots.txt cache. Third-party content on someone else's schedule; keeping
# it out of the history means the log stays a log of positioning, not of other
# people's robots files. A CI runner starts cold and fetches robots.txt once per
# host per run, which is the politeness budget the crawler documents anyway.
.cache/
